veral predictive models to estimate unbiased average ratings and show how textual data can play a critical role in enhancing the predictive power. Our results can help review aggregation platforms to determine mechanisms to cut down the bias on their platforms and can benefit businesses and consumers on their platform to access a fairer metric for service quality.","topics":[],"score":223997,"global_rank":151895},{"name":"TejoramV/CS6910_Assignment2","owner":"TejoramV","html_url":"https://github.com/TejoramV/CS6910_Assignment2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":223990,"global_rank":151936}]